  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Creates severe weather on a chosen hex in range with 7.5m (5 hex) radius. <br><strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"341\">Each round</strong>, all creatures within the area must resolve a vs test of caster's Will Test (bonus {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}}) against target's Strength/Dexterity Test. </p><hr><p>On Caster's success: Knocked Down + pushed back one hex. <br>On failure: pushed back one hex. <br>On failure with differrence of 50 Margin of Success: Target is not pushed. <br><br>The direction of push is  the same for all targets, chosen by caster each round.</p>",
